  "prefLabel": "Jus 2004.07 Decision to Perform an Autopsy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 2004.07 Decision to Perform an Autopsy. The decision as to whether an autopsy will be performed shall, pursuant to RSA 611:7, rest with the county attorney of the county in which the remains were found, the attorney general, or the CME or the CME’s designee.\n\nSource. #8937, eff 7-14-07",
